# Database Migrations

This folder captures the production Supabase schema (functions, tables, RLS
policies) as actual SQL, so it can be reproduced from Git if the project ever
needs a fresh environment, staging DB, or disaster recovery.

**These files reflect what is verified LIVE in production as of Sept 2026.**
They were generated by querying the live database directly (`pg_get_functiondef`,
`pg_policies`, etc.) — not written from memory — so they are accurate.

Going forward: whenever a new DB change is made (new function, new policy, new
table), add a new numbered `.sql` file here in the same session. Do not let
Git and the live database drift apart again.

Run these in order against a fresh Supabase project to reproduce the schema.